          "Question: What is the mechanical durability and cleaning efficacy of the mesh across multiple use-and-regeneration cycles on common fabrics like cotton, wool, and synthetics?",
          "Question: Can the stimulus-and-release mechanism (e.g., a heated docking station) be designed into a safe, convenient, and energy-efficient consumer appliance?",
          "Assumption: The process will not damage delicate fabrics or cause undesirable changes in texture or color over time."
