          "how_it_works": "1. The device consists of a multi-layered cleaning pad, with layers for physical scrubbing, biological action (e.g., immobilized enzymes), and wicking/absorption. 2. A garment is pressed into or passed through the device. 3. A minimal amount of water or cleaning solution is pulsed through the strata, activating the biological layer and flushing away dirt dislodged by the physical layer. 4. The layered structure ensures efficient use of every drop of water.",
