              "source_domain_summary": "This source provides care instructions for various high-performance upholstery fabrics sold for furniture. It explicitly differentiates between full washing and 'spot cleaning' techniques for stain removal, often recommending minimal use of water or solvent-based cleaners.",
              "inspiring_principle": "Localized treatment of stains ('spot cleaning') is an established and effective method for maintaining textile hygiene, emphasizing minimal application of cleaning agents ('do not oversaturate') to avoid full garment washing.",
