        "concept_description": "A self-contained, reusable pod designed to clean textiles in a low-water environment. This concept miniaturizes industrial-scale water treatment technology, integrating both biological agents to break down organic soils and a regenerable filter media to capture particulates and contaminants in a single unit [1]. The goal is to dramatically reduce water consumption and waste in the laundry cycle by treating and reusing a small amount of water locally within the appliance.",
