        "inspiration_summary": "This concept was sparked by a creative leap: What if the powerful, large-scale purification technologies used to remediate hazardous industrial wastewater could be miniaturized for household use? The inspiration comes directly from observing the dual-process systems used for environmental clean-up, which combine biological bioreactors with regenerable resin filters [1]. The innovation was to re-imagine this industrial-scale infrastructure as a single, compact, consumer-friendly pod that turns a standard washing machine into a highly efficient, localized water treatment facility for fabrics.",
