          "overall_synthesis": "The concept of Modular Garment Construction for Zoned Cleaning originates from a single, powerful analogy drawn from the domain of digital document management. The idea was sparked by observing how a digital document repository offers multiple formats for the same content, including a simplified, 'unformatted text' version. This principle of providing a 'lightweight' alternative for a specific purpose was creatively transposed to the physical world of clothing, leading to a design where garments are deconstructed into a main body (the 'full format') and detachable, high-soil modules (the 'light format') that can be cleaned separately with minimal water.",
