          "one_liner": "A garment constructed from different fabrics in different zones, each optimized for a specific hygienic function like antimicrobial action or wicking.",
          "concept_description": "This concept involves constructing garments from fabrics with distinct, specialized zones that provide different functions. For example, high-sweat areas could be made from highly wicking and antimicrobial fabric, while other areas might be designed for odor-trapping or stain-repellency, creating a multi-functional garment optimized for hygiene.",
